{"id":"n25088-1-8","stage":3,"title":"인정받다 · 受认可","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25088-1-8-1","ko":"김 감독님, 앞으로의 목표가 무엇입니까?","zh":"金导演，您未来的目标是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"감독님,","meaning":"教练，导演","explanation":"감독：教练，导演；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"감독","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15979","senseId":"2","lemma":"감독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞으로의","meaning":"以后，未来","explanation":"앞：以后，未来；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"4","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목표가","meaning":"目标","explanation":"목표：目标；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목표","audio":"/audio/3182dd7d3d31e49a00b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69467","senseId":"1","lemma":"목표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇입니까?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7fcf6259bbb0a418","term":"감독","zh":"教练，导演","audio":"/audio/7fcf6259bbb0a41897ec.mp3","entryId":"15979","definition":"在演出、电影、体育比赛等中指挥并负责全盘事宜的人。","pronunciation":["감독"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"以后，未来","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"将来的时间。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"3182dd7d3d31e49a","term":"목표","zh":"目标","audio":"/audio/3182dd7d3d31e49a00b9.mp3","entryId":"69467","definition":"为了实现某个目的而必须达到的具体对象。","pronunciation":["목표"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]}],"audio":"/audio/1337bc48233a6890c45f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25088-1-8-2","ko":"세계적으로 인정받는 영화감독이 되는 것입니다.","zh":"成为得到世界认可的电影导演。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세계적으로","meaning":"世界性的，全球性的","explanation":"세계적：世界性的，全球性的；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"세계적","audio":"/audio/8807f007f592e5f90bf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64043","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인정받는","meaning":"受认可，被肯定，被承认","explanation":"인정받다：受认可，被肯定，被承认；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"인정받다","audio":"/audio/5c383c4bf54199aa98ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25088","senseId":"1","lemma":"인정받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화감독이","meaning":"电影导演","explanation":"영화감독：电影导演；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"영화감독","audio":"/audio/8f0544cdfc1a4127e6ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68544","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화감독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것입니다.","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8807f007f592e5f9","term":"세계적","zh":"世界性的，全球性的","audio":"/audio/8807f007f592e5f90bf3.mp3","entryId":"64043","definition":"规模或影响等波及全世界或是全世界最杰出的。","pronunciation":["세ː계적","세ː게적"]},{"id":"5c383c4bf54199aa","term":"인정받다","zh":"受认可，被肯定，被承认","audio":"/audio/5c383c4bf54199aa98ac.mp3","entryId":"25088","definition":"某事物的价值或能力等被认为确实无疑。","pronunciation":["인정받따"]},{"id":"8f0544cdfc1a4127","term":"영화감독","zh":"电影导演","audio":"/audio/8f0544cdfc1a4127e6ef.mp3","entryId":"68544","definition":"制作电影时整体指挥演技、摄影、录音、编辑等的人。","pronunciation":["영화감독"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/4139b5dd7fbffebd5c08.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.871,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25088","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5963,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["成为得到世界认可的电影导演。","金导演，您未来的目标是什么？","敏俊啊！昨天晚上的聚会你怎么没来？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["金导演，您未来的目标是什么？","敏俊啊！昨天晚上的聚会你怎么没来？","成为得到世界认可的电影导演。"],"answer":2}]}
